# Two images build from this context:
#   Dockerfile        serving  — needs go/ and web/
#   Dockerfile.batch  batch    — needs python/ (the uv workspace)
# Keep everything else out, and keep host build artifacts / caches out of the
# image (each build makes its own).
*
!go
!web
!python
go/bin
web/node_modules
web/dist
web/.vite
**/*.tsbuildinfo
python/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
